.Dd June 27, 2026
.Dt XCALENDAR 1
.Sh NAME
.Nm xcalendar
.Nd simple calendar for X
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl hvf
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Fl h
show usage
.It Fl v
display the program version
.It Fl f
forces normal fullscreen instead of override redirect one
.El
.Sh CONTROLS
.Bl -bullet -compact -width indent
.It
goto previous/next month with h/l keys
.It
goto previous/next year with j/k keys
.It
goto current year & month with c key
.It
exit the program with q/escape keys
.El
.Sh EVENTS
.Nm
reads recurring events (birthdays, anniversaries and other important dates)
from a
.Xr calrepeat 5
.Pa .calendar
file using libcalrepeat. Every day that has an event is marked with a small dot
in the top-right corner, and a list to the right of the calendar
shows the events of the month being viewed.
.Pp
The file is looked up via the
.Ev XCALENDAR_CALENDAR
environment variable; if it is unset the compile-time default
.Pa ~/.config/xcalendar/events.calendar
is used. A missing or unreadable file is treated as having no events.
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Ev XCALENDAR_CALENDAR
Path of the events file to read.
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It display calendar using Norwegian locale
LANG=nb_NO.UTF-8 xcalendar
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr X 7
.Xr cal 1
